            "body": "This also fixes a known flaky test 👍 \r\n\r\n```\r\nFAILED   test/functional/plugin/lsp/semantic_tokens_spec.lua @ 1851: semantic token highlighting token decoding with deltas response with multiple delta edits\r\ntest/functional/plugin/lsp/semantic_tokens_spec.lua:1851: Row 3 did not match.\r\nExpected:\r\n  |#include <iostream>                     |\r\n  |                                        |\r\n  |*int {8:main}()                              |\r\n  |{                                       |\r\n  |*    int {8:x}();                            |\r\n  |*    double {7:y};                           |\r\n  |*#ifdef {5:__cplusplus}                      |\r\n  |*    {4:std}::{2:cout} << {3:x} << \"\\n\";             |\r\n  |*{6:#else}                                   |\r\n  |*{6:    printf(\"%d\\n\", x);}                  |\r\n  |*{6:^#endif}                                  |\r\n  |}                                       |\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |                                        |\r\nActual:\r\n  |#include <iostream>                     |\r\n  |                                        |\r\n  |*int main()                              |\r\n  |{                                       |\r\n  |*    int x();                            |\r\n  |*    double y;                           |\r\n  |*#ifdef __cplusplus                      |\r\n  |*    std::cout << x << \"\\n\";             |\r\n  |*#else                                   |\r\n  |*    printf(\"%d\\n\", x);                  |\r\n  |*^#endif                                  |\r\n  |}                                       |\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |{1:~                                       }|\r\n  |                                        |\r\n```",
